# The addon must stay LF + ASCII (docs/RULES.md); never let Windows git convert it.
# Scoped to guide/ and archive/ only: compare/ (TUGs) and probe/ hold third-party CRLF files that are kept as-is.
guide/**   text eol=lf
archive/**/*.lua text eol=lf
archive/**/*.toc text eol=lf
tooling/*.py  text eol=lf
weights/*.py  text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.zip binary
*.gz  binary
*.diff -text
